<title>USA: Shanghai Petrochemical sets unchanged div.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Petrochemical sets unchanged div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd said Tuesday directors declared an interim dividend of 0.04 yuan per share, unchanged from its 1995 interim payment, payable September 30 to holders of record September 20.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend is equal to 4.0 yuan per American Depositary Share and payable to ADS holders of record September 19.</p>
</text>
